[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "色んな素材が採れたわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've gathered quite a variety of materials."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。面白そうな素材がいーっぱい！\u3000\nあ～、早く調合してみたいっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! So many interesting ingredients! Ooh, I can't wait to try synthesizing with them!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうしたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "誰かいる。あっちの物陰",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Someone's there. Behind those shadows."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランツェさんたちかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Could it be Lanze and the others?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――あなたたち、誰？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—Who are you people?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……んん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hmm?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（私たちの船の乗組員じゃない。\n\u3000じゃあ、いったい……？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(They're not from our crew. Then who could...?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それはこっちのセリフよ。\nあんたが先に名乗りなさいよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's our line. You should introduce yourself first."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それもそう。あなた、なかなか賢いわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fair point. You're quite clever."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は――ノーヴァ神聖国聖戦士、ベップ・ジムロック",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am Bepp Zimlock, Holy Warrior of the sacred lands of Nova."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ノーヴァ神聖国！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The sacred lands of Nova?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、この子は無数島群域の……！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then she's from the Infinite Island Chain...!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシたち、もうそんな所まで来たんだね！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow, we've already made it this far!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はじめまして、ベップさん。\n私はレスナ・シュテルネンリヒト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's nice to meet you, Ms. Bepp. I'm Resna Sternenlicht."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランターナ大陸から、海を越えてやって来ました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've come across the sea from the Lantarna continent."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "任務の途中、見慣れない船を見かけて来てみたら……\n大陸からの旅人だったなんて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was on patrol when I spotted an unfamiliar ship... To think you'd be travelers from the continent."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へぇ……大陸の人ってこんな感じなのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... So this is what people from the continent are like."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "かわいい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How adorable."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お、お褒めの言葉、ありがとうございます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "O-oh, thank you for the compliment!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん、そうだ。これあげる。美味しいわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, right. Here, take this. It's delicious."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おぉ！\u3000いただきます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! Thank you for the food!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "！\u3000噛めば噛むほど旨味が出ます、ベップさん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "! The more I chew, the more flavorful it gets, Ms. Bepp!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よかった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm glad you like it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ご飯を分けてくれるなんて、\nきっと、すごくいい人よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sharing food with strangers... She must be a really kind person."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは、そうだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haha, you're right!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頂獣のせいで、大陸からの船は来なくなった、\nと聞いていたんだけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I heard ships from the continent stopped coming because of the Apexi."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい、その頂獣を退治して、\n無数島群域に行く予定なんです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, we're planning to defeat that Apexi and make our way to the Infinite Island Chain."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっちの任務っていうのは？\n聖戦士？\u3000だって言ってたけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What about your mission? You mentioned being a Holy Warrior?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頂獣の縄張りまで来て動きを監視しているの。\n私たちは、神聖国の安全を守るのが役目だから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm monitoring the Apexi's movements within its territory. Our duty is to protect the Nova's borders."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、そっちの国とはまだかなり距離があるわよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But your country is still quite far from here, isn't it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうね。ここから船で数日。\nでも、それほどに危険な存在だから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, several days by ship from here. But it's such a dangerous threat that we can't take chances."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この島も、頂獣の縄張りの中よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This island is within the Apexi's territory."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ！？\u3000そうなの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! It is?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、頂獣が出る場所は嵐になるって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I thought storms always appeared where the Apexi shows up..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "嵐になるのは、頂獣が実際にいる場所の近くだけ。\n縄張りはもっと広いの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The storms only occur near where the Apexi is physically present. Its territory is much larger."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そして、その行動範囲は年々広がっている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And that territory grows larger with each passing year."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "つまり、今は運よく出会っていないだけってことね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So we've just been lucky not to encounter it yet."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうね。できるだけ早く、この海域を抜けたほうがいい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exactly. You should leave these waters as quickly as possible."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップさん。私たちはその頂獣……\nクヴァレルガを討伐するつもりです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ms. Bepp. We intend to defeat that Apexi... Kvarelga."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちは、昔のように海を自由に行き来できる\nようにしたいと思っているんです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We want to make the seas free to travel again, just like in the old days."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そのために、色々準備してきたんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've made all sorts of preparations for this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "無数島群域の「ノーヴァ神聖国」からやってきた少女。\n国の安全を守るという使命を帯びた「聖戦士」の一人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A young woman from the sacred lands of Nova in the Infinite Island Chain. One of the Holy Warriors tasked with protecting her nation's security."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ・ジムロック",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp Zimlock"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]